{{!
    @template local_ai_course_assistant/sandbox

    Learner-facing in-browser Python sandbox. Replaces the echoed HTML in
    sandbox.php with a template rendered through the Output API
    (CONTRIB-10574 #273); the three inline script blocks moved to
    amd/src/sandbox.js and the ten inline style attributes to styles.css.

    The runtime location rides on data attributes rather than being echoed
    into a script, so no PHP value is ever interpolated into JavaScript here.
    That retires the class of bug fixed in v7.6.1, where a French apostrophe
    in a lang string closed a hand-quoted JS literal and killed every script
    on the page.

    The starter code inside the textarea is whitespace-sensitive: whatever
    sits between the tags is what the learner sees, so it is deliberately not
    indented to match the surrounding markup.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * pyodidebase - base URL of the Pyodide runtime (admin setting, never empty here)
    * loaderurl - full URL of pyodide.js under that base

    Example context (json):
    {
        "pyodidebase": "https://pyodide.example.org/full/",
        "loaderurl": "https://pyodide.example.org/full/pyodide.js"
    }
}}
<div class="sola-sandbox" data-region="sola-sandbox"
     data-pyodide-base="{{pyodidebase}}" data-pyodide-loader="{{loaderurl}}">
    <h2>{{#str}}sandbox:title, local_ai_course_assistant{{/str}}</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">{{#str}}sandbox:intro, local_ai_course_assistant{{/str}}</p>

    <div id="aica-sandbox-status" class="sola-sandbox-status" role="status">
        {{#str}}sandbox:loading, local_ai_course_assistant{{/str}}
    </div>

    <label for="aica-sandbox-code" class="sola-sandbox-label">
        {{#str}}sandbox:code_label, local_ai_course_assistant{{/str}}
    </label>
    <textarea id="aica-sandbox-code" class="sola-sandbox-code" rows="14" spellcheck="false"
              placeholder="{{#cleanstr}}sandbox:code_placeholder, local_ai_course_assistant{{/cleanstr}}&#10;print('hello')">{{#cleanstr}}sandbox:default_code_comment, local_ai_course_assistant{{/cleanstr}}
for n in range(1, 11):
    print(n, n*n)
</textarea>

    <div class="sola-sandbox-actions">
        <button type="button" id="aica-sandbox-run" class="btn btn-primary" disabled>
            {{#str}}sandbox:run, local_ai_course_assistant{{/str}}
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="aica-sandbox-clear" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">
            {{#str}}sandbox:clear, local_ai_course_assistant{{/str}}
        </button>
        <span id="aica-sandbox-running" class="sola-sandbox-running sola-sandbox-hidden">
            {{#str}}sandbox:running, local_ai_course_assistant{{/str}}
        </span>
    </div>

    <h3 class="sola-sandbox-heading">{{#str}}sandbox:output_heading, local_ai_course_assistant{{/str}}</h3>
    <pre id="aica-sandbox-stdout" class="sola-sandbox-out sola-sandbox-stdout"></pre>
    <pre id="aica-sandbox-stderr" class="sola-sandbox-out sola-sandbox-stderr sola-sandbox-hidden"></pre>

    <p class="sola-sandbox-note">{{#str}}sandbox:privacy_note, local_ai_course_assistant{{/str}}</p>
</div>
